# Kylox's Voltstrider's "if that spell would be put into a graveyard, put it on the bottom of its owner's library instead" and
# Force of Negation's "if it's countered this way, exile it instead of putting it into its owner's graveyard" replace the same
# move to the graveyard (CR 614.1a): the countered spell's controller chooses which applies (CR 616.1). Bot1 collects evidence 6
# with Hill Giant, Lightning Bolt and Faithless Looting (4 + 1 + 1), attacks, and casts the Looting from among them for {R}.
# Bot2 counters it with Force of Negation for its alternative cost (it is not Bot2's turn), exiling Brainstorm, and Bot1 takes
# the rider first: the Looting goes to the bottom of Bot1's library, not into exile, and Force of Negation's exile no longer
# applies (CR 616.1f). The Bolt stays exiled, uncast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Kylox's Voltstrider
Faithless Looting
Lightning Bolt
Island
Hill Giant
Grizzly Bears
Island x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Force of Negation
Brainstorm
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Kylox's Voltstrider.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Hill Giant; Grizzly Bears)
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Kylox's Voltstrider.Activate(Ability: evidence)
Bot1.Choose(Hill Giant; Lightning Bolt; Faithless Looting)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Faithless Looting; Hill Giant; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Attack(Kylox's Voltstrider > Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Faithless Looting)
? Stack = Faithless Looting
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Force of Negation.Cast(Faithless Looting; Ability: exile a blue card)
Bot2.Choose(Brainstorm)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Replace(bottom)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 13
Exile = Hill Giant; Lightning Bolt; Brainstorm
Bot1.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears; Black Lotus
Bot1.Library = Island; Island; Island; Island; Faithless Looting
Bot2.Graveyard = Force of Negation
